# === Substrate decisions ===
#
# [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]],
# [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]] (`prism @kintsugi/roomba`),
# [[architecture-glass-wall-substrate-types]] (transparency inheritance
#   through @kintsugi),
# [[architecture-form-process-partition-at-family-root]] (this species
#   stays under @kintsugi; walking is process-side, not form-side),
# [[feedback-substrate-already-had-the-word]] (~59th instance;
#   roomba-substrate-walker-that-feeds-kintsugi.md §3 verbatim already
#   declared the walker's five actions as `\`-obligation-blocked action
#   bodies; this species mints the four bilateral predicates the walker's
#   discipline discharges per pulse),
# [[feedback-no-bare-types]] (walk_position is a typed record with
#   content_oid identity; never bare refs),
# [[feedback-craft-not-deliver]] (all bilateral bodies `\`-obligation-
#   blocked; consumers pull the realization; Arc-2.4 landing composes
#   sentinels via `apply_h::act`),
# [[feedback-cli-subcommand-nesting-is-geometric]] (species-under-
#   @kintsugi is geometric ground truth per §9 A1 recommendation:
#   the walker's home IS the family it feeds),
# [[feedback-no-rust-extension-shortcut]] (this shard IS the substrate-
#   honest lift of the 2026-07-14 Reed Rust extension; the walker's
#   BUSINESS_LOGIC surface — bilateral discipline discharge — lifts to
